{"id":101,"name":"剧情类型精选","movieIds":[370,37,42,1272,74,818,722,900,1388,625,979,79,681,727,813,895,1278,1296,49,331,344,576,595,823],"detail":{"imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2892515613.webp"},"moviesList":[{"id":370,"title":"白色巨塔白巨塔","ratingNum":9.7,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2892515613.webp","tag":"剧情","address":" 日本","years":"2003","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"财前五郎（唐泽寿明 饰）和里见修二（江口洋介 饰）是同期实习的医生，但二者却走上了截然不同的道路。财前凭借高超的个人技术成为了外科部实际上的第一教授。财前的咄咄逼人让即将退休的第一外科教授东真藏（石坂浩二 饰）感到威胁，东教授决定另立他人。因此极具野心的财前寻求其岳父— —财前妇产诊所院长财前又一（西田敏行 饰）和第一内科教授鹈饲（伊武雅刀 饰）的帮助，通过贿赂和拉帮结派，历经波折，最终获得了第一外科教授的职位。而他的同期，第一内科助教里见却是位实事求是，热心研究的学者。二者的不同选择导致了最后不同的命运。位高权重的财前终于到达梦想的高处，却发现不胜寒风，悲剧也因此上演。\n　　本剧改编自山崎丰子的同名巨作。号称“日本国民级小说”。前后经历过五次翻拍，数次被搬上荧屏。内容直指医院的黑暗面，时隔多年，依旧具有现实意义。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1_Upxg6-NGm7C56jk4rJV0g?pwd=te3c\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":37,"title":"霸王别姬","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2561716440.webp","tag":"No.2豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆 / 中国香港","years":"1993","date":"1993-07-26(中国大陆)、1993-01-01(中国香港)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1665762739.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581065129.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1949228542.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p504397690.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p950669794.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2561716440.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2585897495.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p452855329.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2591403415.webp\"]","descs":"段小楼（张丰毅）与程蝶衣（张国荣）是一对打小一起长大的师兄弟，两人一个演生，一个饰旦，一向配合天衣无缝，尤其一出《霸王别姬》，更是誉满京城，为此，两人约定合演一辈子《霸王别姬》。但两人对戏剧与人生关系的理解有本质不同，段小楼深知戏非人生，程蝶衣则是人戏不分。\n　　段小楼在认为该成家立业之时迎娶了名妓菊仙（巩俐），致使程蝶衣认定菊仙是可耻的第三者，使段小楼做了叛徒，自此，三人围绕一出《霸王别姬》生出的爱恨情仇战开始随着时代风云的变迁不断升级，终酿成悲剧。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/16CErdwtxBKQduPqacq4RRg?pwd=6t6p\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":42,"title":"泰坦尼克号 Titanic","ratingNum":9.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p457760035.webp","tag":"No.3豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国 / 墨西哥","years":"1997","date":"1998-04-03(中国大陆)、2023-04-03(中国大陆重映)、1997-11-01(东京电影节)、1997-12-19(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p457867960.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p457875621.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p590080575.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p645424950.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1460638588.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p457760035.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2889314814.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p457777115.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p457778812.webp\"]","descs":"1912年4月10日，号称 “世界工业史上的奇迹”的豪华客轮泰坦尼克号开始了自己的处女航，从英国的南安普顿出发驶往美国纽约。富家少女罗丝（凯特•温丝莱特）与母亲及未婚夫卡尔坐上了头等舱；另一边，放荡不羁的少年画家杰克（莱昂纳多·迪卡普里奥）也在码头的一场赌博中赢得了下等舱的船票。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Eb80aoJjryW8nI6vHaxc7w?pwd=9bnn\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\